  "notes": "This document is the results from MOVELASER on the 18 m/s Hurdles at the LAC Summer Games 2024, organized by the IEA Wind Task 52. The objective is to increase the accuracy of predicted Rotor-Effective Wind Speed (REWS).\n\nWe focused on pulsed nacelle LiDAR of 4 beams. This document outlines our method to reduce the REWS error of large turbines.",
